soaHcXAQ7kNvwEoj4GW&_nc_oc=Adr8brXlzEK_kFD-jFF5rDbuhX-OLN6Hbzs6VSNP039tgPc1OETHARqMrfa_PA1pwOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af63Ed2Me8Av3_5hmwP8Q7EUrD3x0pIsmh28ZulNeFS7Kg&oe=6A119DD9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BowCourse_Thumbnail.png", "id": "2057677827991603", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393956_2057677831324936_6257418328995593478_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4khLpw3gJM8Q7kNvwEzlXJ6&_nc_oc=Adr3fsrUzNfT0r1emUOhByd2dqtulFc5ZTz06NN7gwbt-zxktddrJTzdGobCR61zi2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6f6cjFR0Hrmz1sOAVciH4oCzUWRhcml4R54iNrX-892g&oe=6A11B7D2"}, "display_name": "Bow Course", "keywords": ["sports", "casual", "archery", "golf", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Immerse yourself in a new VR sport - Archery Golf!\n\nMaster realistic arrow physics and challenge your friends for a round in beautiful and challenging 9 target courses. Gain a competitive edge with skillful usage of different arrows, avoid obstacles and utilize shortcuts. The player with the least amount of shots in the end wins!\n\n**Bow Course will be released in Early Access with two maps and all main game mechanics & features. We aim to add additional maps, character customization and more features during EA. We look forward to hearing your feedback!**\n{1284964985943064}\n**Main Features**\n* Play solo or challenge your friends in multiplayer\n* Realistic bow handling & arrow physics\n* Versatile courses - Each 9 target course offers several routes and shortcuts that players can tactically use with different arrows\n* Fun and challenging gameplay \u2014 Easy to pick up but offers depth to master\n* Practice at the shooting range in the main hub area\n* Customizable difficulty - choose starting point, wind conditions & more\n* Play comfortably with teleport, smooth locomotion and other settings\n{1772529446871531}", "short_descript